[
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.63,
"text": "In 1909, a"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 1.63,
"t1": 3.41,
"text": "museum in New York put a shark's"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 3.41,
"t1": 4.97,
"text": "jaw on display."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 4.97,
"t1": 6.64,
"text": "It was so big that people could sit"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 6.64,
"t1": 7.88,
"text": "inside it, with room to spare."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 7.88,
"t1": 9.12,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 9.12,
"t1": 10.72,
"text": "It was built around real fossil"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 10.72,
"t1": 12.25,
"text": "teeth. And from the size"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 12.25,
"t1": 14.02,
"text": "of that jaw, people imagined"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 14.02,
"t1": 15.8,
"text": "a shark that could have been thirty metres"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 15.8,
"t1": 17.54,
"text": "long. There was just one"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 17.54,
"t1": 19.15,
"text": "problem. The jaw was"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 19.15,
"t1": 20.83,
"text": "wrong. And so was almost"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 20.83,
"t1": 22.38,
"text": "everything people pictured behind"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 22.38,
"t1": 23.8,
"text": "it. For more than a"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 23.8,
"t1": 25.45,
"text": "century, we have imagined"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 25.45,
"t1": 27.07,
"text": "megalodon as a great white"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 27.07,
"t1": 28.78,
"text": "shark, only bigger."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 28.78,
"t1": 30.02,
"text": "The same face."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 30.02,
"t1": 31.55,
"text": "The same thick body."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 31.55,
"t1": 33.29,
"text": "Just scaled up until it could swallow"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 33.29,
"t1": 35.06,
"text": "a car. But in the last few"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 35.06,
"t1": 36.85,
"text": "years, scientists have started"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 36.85,
"t1": 38.72,
"text": "to say something surprising."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 38.72,
"t1": 40.37,
"text": "Megalodon probably did not look"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 40.37,
"t1": 41.82,
"text": "like that at all."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 41.82,
"t1": 43.34,
"text": "So what did the biggest shark that"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 43.34,
"t1": 44.39,
"text": "ever lived really look like?"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 44.39,
"t1": 45.44,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 45.44,
"t1": 46.96,
"text": "On the way, you will find out"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 46.96,
"t1": 48.55,
"text": "why every picture of megalodon"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 48.55,
"t1": 49.65,
"text": "is a guess."
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 49.65,
"t1": 51.4,
"text": "What one spine in a museum"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 51.4,
"t1": 52.91,
"text": "revealed. And the shape"
},
{
"scene": "01",
"t0": 52.91,
"t1": 54.91,
"text": "scientists now think it had."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.52,
"text": "For centuries, people"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 1.52,
"t1": 3.45,
"text": "in Europe found strange stones"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 3.45,
"t1": 5.04,
"text": "in rocks and cliffs."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 5.04,
"t1": 6.08,
"text": "They were shaped like triangles."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 6.08,
"t1": 7.12,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 7.12,
"t1": 9.02,
"text": "Some were as big as a hand."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 9.02,
"t1": 10.61,
"text": "They had sharp, sawlike"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 10.61,
"t1": 12.11,
"text": "edges. People called"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 12.11,
"t1": 13.85,
"text": "them tongue stones."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 13.85,
"t1": 15.35,
"text": "Some believed they were the tongues"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 15.35,
"t1": 16.92,
"text": "of snakes, turned to"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 16.92,
"t1": 18.56,
"text": "stone. Others thought they"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 18.56,
"t1": 20.13,
"text": "fell from the sky."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 20.13,
"t1": 22.08,
"text": "In 1667,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 22.08,
"t1": 23.96,
"text": "a Danish anatomist called Nicolas"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 23.96,
"t1": 25.76,
"text": "Steno published his study"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 25.76,
"t1": 27.73,
"text": "of a great white shark's head,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 27.73,
"t1": 29.49,
"text": "sent to him in Florence."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 29.49,
"t1": 31.09,
"text": "He looked at its teeth,"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 31.09,
"t1": 32.67,
"text": "row after row of them."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 32.67,
"t1": 34.35,
"text": "And he argued that the tongue stones"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 34.35,
"t1": 36.32,
"text": "were not tongues at all."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 36.32,
"t1": 37.62,
"text": "They were teeth."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 37.62,
"t1": 39.29,
"text": "The teeth of sharks that had lived"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 39.29,
"t1": 40.59,
"text": "long ago."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 40.59,
"t1": 42.35,
"text": "He was not the first to say it."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 42.35,
"t1": 44.22,
"text": "But he made the case so clearly"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 44.22,
"t1": 45.34,
"text": "that it helped start a new science:"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 45.34,
"t1": 46.47,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 46.47,
"t1": 48.35,
"text": "the study of fossils."
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 48.35,
"t1": 49.91,
"text": "Some of those tongue stones were"
},
{
"scene": "02",
"t0": 49.91,
"t1": 51.51,
"text": "megalodon teeth."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.59,
"text": "And that is still almost all we"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 1.59,
"t1": 2.61,
"text": "have."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 2.61,
"t1": 4.15,
"text": "A shark's skeleton is not made"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 4.15,
"t1": 5.71,
"text": "of bone. It is made of"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 5.71,
"t1": 7.36,
"text": "cartilage, the same bendy"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 7.36,
"t1": 8.38,
"text": "material as the tip of your nose."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 8.38,
"t1": 9.4,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 9.4,
"t1": 11.01,
"text": "When a shark dies, the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 11.01,
"t1": 12.67,
"text": "cartilage rots away."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 12.67,
"t1": 14.43,
"text": "Almost nothing is left."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 14.43,
"t1": 16.23,
"text": "Except the teeth."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 16.23,
"t1": 17.6,
"text": "Sharks shed teeth all their"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 17.6,
"t1": 18.62,
"text": "lives, thousands of them."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 18.62,
"t1": 19.65,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 19.65,
"t1": 21.39,
"text": "So megalodon left behind teeth"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 21.39,
"t1": 22.91,
"text": "everywhere. On every"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 22.91,
"t1": 23.93,
"text": "continent except Antarctica."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 23.93,
"t1": 24.94,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 24.94,
"t1": 26.55,
"text": "The biggest ones are around eighteen"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 26.55,
"t1": 27.93,
"text": "centimetres long."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 27.93,
"t1": 29.43,
"text": "Nearly three times the length"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 29.43,
"t1": 31.35,
"text": "of a great white's tooth."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 31.35,
"t1": 32.9,
"text": "In the 1800s, the"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 32.9,
"t1": 34.44,
"text": "Swiss naturalist Louis"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 34.44,
"t1": 36.28,
"text": "Agassiz gave the species"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 36.28,
"t1": 37.33,
"text": "its name."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 37.33,
"t1": 38.41,
"text": "Megalodon."
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 38.41,
"t1": 40.0,
"text": "It simply means \"big"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 40.0,
"t1": 41.57,
"text": "tooth\". But imagine"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 41.57,
"t1": 43.36,
"text": "trying to draw an animal you have never"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 43.36,
"t1": 44.86,
"text": "seen, when all you have"
},
{
"scene": "03",
"t0": 44.86,
"t1": 46.05,
"text": "is its teeth."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.65,
"text": "So scientists took"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 1.65,
"t1": 2.96,
"text": "a shortcut."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 2.96,
"t1": 4.55,
"text": "Megalodon teeth are"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 4.55,
"t1": 6.16,
"text": "triangles with serrated"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 6.16,
"t1": 8.12,
"text": "edges. So are the teeth"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 8.12,
"t1": 9.83,
"text": "of the great white shark."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 9.83,
"t1": 11.65,
"text": "They look like the same design,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 11.65,
"t1": 12.9,
"text": "just bigger."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 12.9,
"t1": 14.35,
"text": "So for a long time,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 14.35,
"t1": 16.05,
"text": "megalodon was treated as a kind"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 16.05,
"t1": 17.89,
"text": "of giant great white."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 17.89,
"t1": 19.45,
"text": "It was even placed in the same"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 19.45,
"t1": 20.75,
"text": "genus, Carcharodon."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 20.75,
"t1": 22.05,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 22.05,
"t1": 24.03,
"text": "If the teeth were like a great white's,"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 24.03,
"t1": 25.74,
"text": "why not the rest of it?"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 25.74,
"t1": 27.12,
"text": "Take a great white."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 27.12,
"t1": 28.25,
"text": "Make its teeth three times bigger."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 28.25,
"t1": 29.37,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 29.37,
"t1": 30.98,
"text": "Then make the whole shark three"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 30.98,
"t1": 32.77,
"text": "times bigger to match."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 32.77,
"t1": 34.4,
"text": "That is the megalodon you have seen"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 34.4,
"t1": 35.77,
"text": "in films, books and"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 35.77,
"t1": 37.0,
"text": "documentaries."
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 37.0,
"t1": 38.66,
"text": "A great white, scaled"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 38.66,
"t1": 40.55,
"text": "up. And that is exactly"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 40.55,
"t1": 42.33,
"text": "what the museum in 1909"
},
{
"scene": "04",
"t0": 42.33,
"t1": 42.97,
"text": "did."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.81,
"text": "The man behind the 1909"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 1.81,
"t1": 3.48,
"text": "jaw was Bashford Dean,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 3.48,
"t1": 4.53,
"text": "a fish expert at the museum."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 4.53,
"t1": 5.57,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 5.57,
"t1": 7.3,
"text": "He set real megalodon teeth"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 7.3,
"t1": 8.98,
"text": "into a jaw shaped like a great"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 8.98,
"t1": 10.5,
"text": "white's. But he made the"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 10.5,
"t1": 12.15,
"text": "cartilage of the jaw far too"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 12.15,
"t1": 13.91,
"text": "big, and filled it with teeth"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 13.91,
"t1": 15.08,
"text": "that were too large for their places."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 15.08,
"t1": 16.25,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 16.25,
"t1": 17.27,
"text": "So the jaw came out enormous."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 17.27,
"t1": 18.29,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 18.29,
"t1": 20.03,
"text": "And so did the shark people imagined"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 20.03,
"t1": 21.13,
"text": "behind it."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 21.13,
"t1": 23.0,
"text": "Around thirty metres long."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 23.0,
"t1": 24.61,
"text": "Later scientists rebuilt the jaw"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 24.61,
"t1": 26.29,
"text": "more carefully, and the estimates"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 26.29,
"t1": 27.38,
"text": "came down."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 27.38,
"t1": 29.19,
"text": "By the late twentieth century,"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 29.19,
"t1": 30.88,
"text": "most of them put the biggest megalodons"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 30.88,
"t1": 32.41,
"text": "at around fifteen to eighteen"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 32.41,
"t1": 33.41,
"text": "metres."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 33.41,
"t1": 34.81,
"text": "Still gigantic."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 34.81,
"t1": 36.36,
"text": "But here is the thing."
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 36.36,
"t1": 38.28,
"text": "All of those estimates still"
},
{
"scene": "05",
"t0": 38.28,
"t1": 40.2,
"text": "used the great white as the model."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.63,
"text": "And then the family tree"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 1.63,
"t1": 2.87,
"text": "fell apart."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 2.87,
"t1": 4.42,
"text": "When scientists looked closely"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 4.42,
"t1": 5.99,
"text": "at fossil teeth from millions of"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 5.99,
"t1": 7.59,
"text": "years of sharks, they found"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 7.59,
"t1": 9.32,
"text": "that megalodon's line goes back"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 9.32,
"t1": 10.95,
"text": "a long way. Its oldest"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 10.95,
"t1": 12.83,
"text": "clear ancestor was a shark"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 12.83,
"t1": 13.91,
"text": "called Otodus obliquus,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 13.91,
"t1": 15.0,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 15.0,
"t1": 16.81,
"text": "which lived around fifty-five million"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 16.81,
"t1": 17.95,
"text": "years ago."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 17.95,
"t1": 19.06,
"text": "The great white's line is different."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 19.06,
"t1": 20.18,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 20.18,
"t1": 22.05,
"text": "It seems to come from a smaller,"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 22.05,
"t1": 23.67,
"text": "mako-like shark."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 23.67,
"t1": 25.48,
"text": "So megalodon is not the great white's"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 25.48,
"t1": 26.55,
"text": "grandfather."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 26.55,
"t1": 28.26,
"text": "They are distant cousins."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 28.26,
"t1": 29.95,
"text": "Today, megalodon is placed"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 29.95,
"t1": 31.4,
"text": "in its own genus:"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 31.4,
"t1": 32.51,
"text": "Otodus."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 32.51,
"t1": 34.16,
"text": "Their teeth look alike because they did"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 34.16,
"t1": 35.44,
"text": "a similar job."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 35.44,
"t1": 36.99,
"text": "Cutting big chunks out"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 36.99,
"t1": 38.62,
"text": "of big animals."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 38.62,
"t1": 40.15,
"text": "And that means there was never a"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 40.15,
"t1": 41.73,
"text": "good reason to give megalodon"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 41.73,
"t1": 43.49,
"text": "a great white's body."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 43.49,
"t1": 45.05,
"text": "This is why every picture of"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 45.05,
"t1": 46.05,
"text": "megalodon is a guess."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 46.05,
"t1": 47.06,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 47.06,
"t1": 48.65,
"text": "Even the most famous ones are"
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 48.65,
"t1": 49.65,
"text": "a great white in disguise."
},
{
"scene": "06",
"t0": 49.65,
"t1": 50.65,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.63,
"text": "But there is one fossil that is"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 1.63,
"t1": 3.24,
"text": "different. In a museum"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 3.24,
"t1": 4.76,
"text": "in Brussels, there is a set"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 4.76,
"t1": 6.5,
"text": "of megalodon vertebrae,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 6.5,
"t1": 8.13,
"text": "the discs of a spine,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 8.13,
"t1": 9.84,
"text": "all from one shark."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 9.84,
"t1": 10.86,
"text": "One hundred and forty-one of them."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 10.86,
"t1": 11.87,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 11.87,
"t1": 13.55,
"text": "It is the most complete piece"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 13.55,
"t1": 15.08,
"text": "of a megalodon body ever"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 15.08,
"t1": 16.59,
"text": "found. And it has been"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 16.59,
"t1": 18.4,
"text": "studied again and again."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 18.4,
"t1": 20.23,
"text": "In 2021, scientists"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 20.23,
"t1": 22.1,
"text": "scanned three of the discs."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 22.1,
"t1": 23.68,
"text": "Inside, like the rings of"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 23.68,
"t1": 24.71,
"text": "a tree, they counted forty-six"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 24.71,
"t1": 25.74,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 25.74,
"t1": 26.82,
"text": "growth bands."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 26.82,
"t1": 28.56,
"text": "That shark was probably forty-six"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 28.56,
"t1": 30.23,
"text": "years old when it died, and"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 30.23,
"t1": 32.14,
"text": "around nine metres long."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 32.14,
"t1": 33.86,
"text": "Working backwards through the rings,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 33.86,
"t1": 35.75,
"text": "they found something even stranger."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 35.75,
"t1": 37.51,
"text": "When it was born, it was already about"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 37.51,
"t1": 38.74,
"text": "two metres long."
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 38.74,
"t1": 40.28,
"text": "That is longer than most adult"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 40.28,
"t1": 41.85,
"text": "humans. Before birth,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 41.85,
"t1": 43.38,
"text": "the babies likely grew by eating"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 43.38,
"t1": 45.06,
"text": "other eggs inside their mother,"
},
{
"scene": "07",
"t0": 45.06,
"t1": 46.76,
"text": "as some living sharks do."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.73,
"text": "In 2022,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 1.73,
"t1": 3.23,
"text": "a team used that spine to"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 3.23,
"t1": 4.85,
"text": "build the first 3D model"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 4.85,
"t1": 5.92,
"text": "of a megalodon's whole body."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 5.92,
"t1": 7.0,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 7.0,
"t1": 8.67,
"text": "They lined up the vertebrae."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 8.67,
"t1": 9.75,
"text": "They added a scanned set of teeth."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 9.75,
"t1": 10.82,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 10.82,
"t1": 11.88,
"text": "And then, to fill in the rest,"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 11.88,
"t1": 12.95,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 12.95,
"t1": 14.85,
"text": "they wrapped it in the shape of a great"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 14.85,
"t1": 16.15,
"text": "white shark."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 16.15,
"t1": 18.06,
"text": "Their megalodon was sixteen metres"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 18.06,
"t1": 19.57,
"text": "long and weighed more than"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 19.57,
"t1": 21.32,
"text": "sixty-one tonnes."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 21.32,
"t1": 22.84,
"text": "It was big enough to swallow prey"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 22.84,
"t1": 24.51,
"text": "the size of a killer whale."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 24.51,
"t1": 26.43,
"text": "And after eating a single eight-metre"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 26.43,
"t1": 28.04,
"text": "whale, it might have been able to"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 28.04,
"t1": 29.59,
"text": "swim thousands of kilometres"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 29.59,
"t1": 31.27,
"text": "without eating again for about two"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 31.27,
"t1": 32.29,
"text": "months."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 32.29,
"t1": 34.04,
"text": "It was the best model yet."
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 34.04,
"t1": 35.57,
"text": "But it still had a great white's"
},
{
"scene": "08",
"t0": 35.57,
"t1": 36.39,
"text": "body."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.62,
"text": "In 2024,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 1.62,
"t1": 3.58,
"text": "another team looked at that same spine"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 3.58,
"t1": 5.15,
"text": "and found a problem."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 5.15,
"t1": 6.73,
"text": "Measured end to end,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 6.73,
"t1": 8.48,
"text": "the column was about eleven metres"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 8.48,
"t1": 9.63,
"text": "long. That is just the spine."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 9.63,
"t1": 10.79,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 10.79,
"t1": 11.86,
"text": "No head. No tail."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 11.86,
"t1": 12.92,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 12.92,
"t1": 14.51,
"text": "If megalodon had been shaped like"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 14.51,
"t1": 16.24,
"text": "a great white, that spine"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 16.24,
"t1": 17.85,
"text": "would belong to a shark of about"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 17.85,
"t1": 19.05,
"text": "nine metres."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 19.05,
"t1": 20.6,
"text": "The numbers did not"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 20.6,
"t1": 22.14,
"text": "fit. And the discs"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 22.14,
"t1": 24.07,
"text": "themselves were too thin."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 24.07,
"t1": 25.85,
"text": "A great white has thick,"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 25.85,
"t1": 27.46,
"text": "heavy vertebrae, built"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 27.46,
"t1": 29.23,
"text": "to hold up a short, stocky"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 29.23,
"t1": 30.95,
"text": "body. Megalodon's were"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 30.95,
"t1": 32.46,
"text": "slimmer. There was only"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 32.46,
"t1": 34.23,
"text": "one way to make it work."
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 34.23,
"t1": 35.76,
"text": "Megalodon's body must"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 35.76,
"t1": 36.77,
"text": "have been longer and slimmer"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 36.77,
"t1": 37.77,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "09",
"t0": 37.77,
"t1": 39.24,
"text": "than a great white's."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.64,
"text": "In 2025,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 1.64,
"t1": 2.68,
"text": "the same scientists went further."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 2.68,
"t1": 3.72,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 3.72,
"t1": 5.4,
"text": "They compared megalodon's spine"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 5.4,
"t1": 6.57,
"text": "with the bodies of many living sharks,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 6.57,
"t1": 7.73,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 7.73,
"t1": 8.87,
"text": "to find the shape that fits best."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 8.87,
"t1": 10.0,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 10.0,
"t1": 11.09,
"text": "The answer was not a great white."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 11.09,
"t1": 12.18,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 12.18,
"t1": 13.79,
"text": "It was something closer to a lemon"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 13.79,
"t1": 15.37,
"text": "shark, or a giant,"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 15.37,
"t1": 16.95,
"text": "stretched version of a sandbar"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 16.95,
"t1": 18.65,
"text": "shark. Long and"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 18.65,
"t1": 20.03,
"text": "streamlined."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 20.03,
"t1": 21.47,
"text": "They also pointed out that a"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 21.47,
"t1": 23.31,
"text": "huge, tank-like"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 23.31,
"t1": 24.81,
"text": "great white body"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 24.81,
"t1": 26.47,
"text": "would be a terrible design at that"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 26.47,
"t1": 28.09,
"text": "size. It would cost too"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 28.09,
"t1": 29.75,
"text": "much energy just to push"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 29.75,
"t1": 31.0,
"text": "through the water."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 31.0,
"t1": 32.97,
"text": "A long, slender body"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 32.97,
"t1": 34.93,
"text": "glides more easily."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 34.93,
"t1": 36.61,
"text": "With that shape, the biggest"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 36.61,
"t1": 38.35,
"text": "megalodons may have reached around"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 38.35,
"t1": 39.83,
"text": "twenty-four metres."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 39.83,
"t1": 40.87,
"text": "As long as two buses."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 40.87,
"t1": 41.91,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 41.91,
"t1": 43.79,
"text": "Not a giant great white."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 43.79,
"t1": 45.64,
"text": "Something leaner, longer"
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 45.64,
"t1": 47.02,
"text": "and stranger."
},
{
"scene": "10",
"t0": 47.02,
"t1": 48.9,
"text": "A giant of its own kind."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.56,
"text": "The teeth had one"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 1.56,
"t1": 3.06,
"text": "more secret."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 3.06,
"t1": 4.78,
"text": "In 2023,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 4.78,
"t1": 6.35,
"text": "scientists measured special"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 6.35,
"t1": 7.37,
"text": "forms of carbon and oxygen"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 7.37,
"t1": 8.39,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 8.39,
"t1": 10.17,
"text": "locked inside megalodon's tooth"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 10.17,
"t1": 11.75,
"text": "enamel. These can show"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 11.75,
"t1": 13.35,
"text": "the temperature of the body the tooth"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 13.35,
"t1": 14.43,
"text": "grew in."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 14.43,
"t1": 16.18,
"text": "Megalodon's body averaged"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 16.18,
"t1": 17.57,
"text": "about twenty-seven degrees"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 17.57,
"t1": 18.73,
"text": "Celsius."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 18.73,
"t1": 20.48,
"text": "Warmer than the sea around it,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 20.48,
"t1": 22.09,
"text": "and warmer than other sharks of its"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 22.09,
"t1": 23.59,
"text": "time. Like great"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 23.59,
"t1": 25.29,
"text": "whites and makos today,"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 25.29,
"t1": 26.44,
"text": "it was probably partly"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 26.44,
"t1": 27.67,
"text": "warm-blooded."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 27.67,
"t1": 29.2,
"text": "That makes a shark faster and"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 29.2,
"t1": 31.08,
"text": "stronger in cold water."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 31.08,
"t1": 32.09,
"text": "But it also comes at a price."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 32.09,
"t1": 33.1,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 33.1,
"t1": 34.14,
"text": "A warm body needs a lot of food."
},
{
"scene": "11",
"t0": 34.14,
"t1": 35.19,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.16,
"text": "And megalodon ate a lot."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 1.16,
"t1": 2.32,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 2.32,
"t1": 3.95,
"text": "Fossil whale bones from that time"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 3.95,
"t1": 5.76,
"text": "carry deep cuts and gouges"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 5.76,
"t1": 7.7,
"text": "that match megalodon teeth."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 7.7,
"t1": 9.57,
"text": "Some are on the tail and the flippers,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 9.57,
"t1": 11.26,
"text": "as if the shark attacked the parts"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 11.26,
"t1": 12.29,
"text": "that let a whale swim away."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 12.29,
"t1": 13.32,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 13.32,
"t1": 15.32,
"text": "Its world was full of whales,"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 15.32,
"t1": 16.88,
"text": "seals, sea cows and"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 16.88,
"t1": 18.04,
"text": "big fish."
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 18.04,
"t1": 19.57,
"text": "For millions of years, it was"
},
{
"scene": "12",
"t0": 19.57,
"t1": 21.55,
"text": "the largest predator in the sea."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.55,
"text": "Then, around three and a"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 1.55,
"t1": 3.09,
"text": "half million years ago,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 3.09,
"t1": 4.85,
"text": "megalodon vanished."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 4.85,
"t1": 6.46,
"text": "The planet was cooling."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 6.46,
"t1": 8.45,
"text": "Warm, shallow coastal seas,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 8.45,
"t1": 10.21,
"text": "where young megalodons grew up,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 10.21,
"t1": 11.52,
"text": "were shrinking."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 11.52,
"t1": 12.99,
"text": "Many of the whales it hunted were"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 12.99,
"t1": 14.8,
"text": "changing, or moving to cold"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 14.8,
"t1": 16.6,
"text": "waters a warm-bodied giant"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 16.6,
"t1": 18.43,
"text": "could not easily follow."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 18.43,
"t1": 19.52,
"text": "And there was a new rival."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 19.52,
"t1": 20.61,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 20.61,
"t1": 22.14,
"text": "In 2022,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 22.14,
"t1": 23.97,
"text": "scientists compared the zinc in fossil"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 23.97,
"t1": 25.48,
"text": "teeth, which shows how"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 25.48,
"t1": 27.05,
"text": "high up the food chain an animal"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 27.05,
"t1": 28.55,
"text": "fed. Megalodon and"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 28.55,
"t1": 29.55,
"text": "early great whites overlapped."
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 29.55,
"t1": 30.56,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 30.56,
"t1": 32.2,
"text": "They may have been competing for the same"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 32.2,
"t1": 33.73,
"text": "food. A smaller,"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 33.73,
"t1": 35.5,
"text": "more flexible hunter, against"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 35.5,
"t1": 37.23,
"text": "a huge one that needed enormous"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 37.23,
"t1": 38.83,
"text": "meals. The great white"
},
{
"scene": "13",
"t0": 38.83,
"t1": 39.99,
"text": "is still here."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.18,
"text": "So is this the final answer?"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 1.18,
"t1": 2.36,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 2.36,
"t1": 3.93,
"text": "No. Not every scientist"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 3.93,
"t1": 5.48,
"text": "agrees. Some say the"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 5.48,
"t1": 7.02,
"text": "case for a slender body is still"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 7.02,
"t1": 9.0,
"text": "tentative. We have no head,"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 9.0,
"t1": 10.84,
"text": "no fins, no tail."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 10.84,
"t1": 12.13,
"text": "One spine and a lot of teeth."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 12.13,
"t1": 13.43,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 13.43,
"t1": 15.03,
"text": "Until someone finds more of a"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 15.03,
"t1": 16.54,
"text": "megalodon, every"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 16.54,
"t1": 18.14,
"text": "picture of it, including"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 18.14,
"t1": 19.79,
"text": "the one in this video, is"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 19.79,
"t1": 21.42,
"text": "a best guess."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 21.42,
"t1": 23.41,
"text": "But the guesses are getting better."
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 23.41,
"t1": 25.17,
"text": "And they are moving away from the old"
},
{
"scene": "14",
"t0": 25.17,
"t1": 25.89,
"text": "idea."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 0.0,
"t1": 1.5,
"text": "For more than a hundred years,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 1.5,
"t1": 3.25,
"text": "we drew megalodon by copying"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 3.25,
"t1": 4.69,
"text": "the shark we knew."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 4.69,
"t1": 6.51,
"text": "But the biggest shark that ever lived"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 6.51,
"t1": 8.32,
"text": "was not a great white with the volume"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 8.32,
"t1": 9.34,
"text": "turned up. It was longer."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 9.34,
"t1": 10.36,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 10.36,
"t1": 12.33,
"text": "Leaner. Warm-blooded."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 12.33,
"t1": 14.21,
"text": "Born bigger than a grown human."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 14.21,
"t1": 15.9,
"text": "And it hunted whales for millions"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 15.9,
"t1": 17.7,
"text": "of years before the sea changed"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 17.7,
"t1": 18.8,
"text": "around it."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 18.8,
"t1": 19.86,
"text": "We still have not seen its face."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 19.86,
"t1": 20.91,
"text": "\u2026"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 20.91,
"t1": 22.83,
"text": "All we have is its teeth."
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 22.83,
"t1": 24.68,
"text": "And the teeth have been telling us,"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 24.68,
"t1": 26.2,
"text": "all along, that it was something"
},
{
"scene": "15",
"t0": 26.2,
"t1": 27.77,
"text": "we had never imagined."
}
]